,"textHtml":"Our Governance, Risk, and Compliance services are geared towards empowering organizations with robust frameworks and strategies to effectively manage their cybersecurity challenges. Leveraging industry-leading standards such as ISO 27001:2022 and the NIST Cybersecurity Framework, we offer tailored assessments and guidance to align businesses with best practices in governance, risk management, and compliance. Our experienced professionals assist in implementing the necessary controls and measures, helping organizations identify, protect, detect, respond to, and recover from cyber incidents.\n<p>Through our specialized services, businesses gain a solid foundation for mitigating risks, complying with regulatory requirements, and proactively addressing cybersecurity challenges, instilling a culture of security awareness and resilience throughout their operations.</p>","button":{"label":"Learn more","href":"/services/governance-risk-and-compliance/","variant":"flat","icon":null,"iconPosition":"right","style":{"xl":{"fontSize":"14px","fontWeight":"500","lineHeight":"56px","color":"rgb(0, 68, 147)","borderTop":"1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238)","height":"56px"}},"newTab":false},"style":{"xl":{}},"parts":{"wrap":{"xl":{"backgroundColor":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","borderRadius":"5px","boxShadow":"rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.1) 0px 0px 40px 0px","textAlign":"left"}},"text":{"xl":{"fontSize":"17px","fontWeight":"400","lineHeight":"29.58px","color":"rgb(105, 105, 105)","textAlign":"left","marginTop":"12px"}},"content":{"xl":{"fontSize":"17px","fontWeight":"400","lineHeight":"29.58px","color":"rgb(105, 105, 105)","textAlign":"left","paddingTop":"32px","paddingBottom":"88px","paddingLeft":"35px","paddingRight":"35px"}},"btnText":{"xl":{"fontSize":"14px","fontWeight":"500","lineHeight":"56px","color":"rgb(0, 68, 147)","textAlign":"center"}}}}]}]},{"kind":"spacer","height":{"xl":{"height":"32px"}}},{"kind":"row","id":"tm-row-inner-6af31750cd259","fullWidth":false,"stretchContent":false,